WEBVTT

00:02:58.641 --> 00:03:00.054
In less than a decade,

00:03:00.078 --> 00:03:02.283
with international support,

00:03:02.307 --> 00:03:05.752
the state forest departments
and the local communities

00:03:05.776 --> 00:03:08.198
worked together to restore

00:03:08.222 --> 00:03:13.171
over 20,000 acres
of unproductive fish and shrimp farms

00:03:13.195 --> 00:03:15.085
back into mangroves.

00:03:16.134 --> 00:03:18.396
About five years ago,

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.070
guess who we discovered
in these restored mangroves?

00:03:24.997 --> 00:03:29.363
When we shared images
of these fishing cats with local people,

00:03:29.387 --> 00:03:31.506
we were able to build pride among them